OL,3,GNEWSAWoman in 70s dies after two-car
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in her 70's has died in
OL,7,Fhospital after a crash on Friday.
OL,9,FWest Mercia Police said her Alfa Romeo
OL,10,Fcollided with a Mercedes on the A41
OL,11,Fnear Hinstock, Shropshire, at about
OL,12,F18:00 BST.
OL,14,FIt said two people travelling in the
OL,15,FMercedes suffered minor injuries and
OL,16,Fwent to hospital as a precaution.
OL,18,FA 43-year-old man was arrested on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of causing death by dangerous
OL,20,Fdriving, and has since been released,
OL,21,Fthe force said.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
